; Ridge Racer Type 4 (USA, SLUS-00797) — 60 FPS + 16:9 pack by AEONG_AEONG.
; https://gbatemp.net/threads/i-created-60-fps-widescreen-cheat-codes-for-ridge-racer-type-4.684958/
;   ("R4 60FPS Widescreen Patch (US SLUS-00797).cht" from that thread's Drive folder)
; Sections are independent: enable only the ones you want.
;   60 FPS patch          render at 60 instead of 30 — REQUIRES CPU speed 300%
;                         (Console.CPUOverclock* in gamesettings/SLUS-00797.ini)
;   16:9 Widescreen patch UI + FOV for 16:9 — REQUIRES aspect 16:9 with the
;                         emulator's widescreen hack OFF (same ini)
;   CPU Marker            shows opponent positions on the minimap (GP, Extra Trial)
;   16:9 FMV              resizes the opening movie to 16:9
; Every write is guarded by D001E706 AE40, so the file is ~9k lines; that is the
; upstream form, not a merge artifact.
[60 FPS patch]
Description = [SLUS-00797 Ridge Racer Type 4 US version 60 FPS patch] Set CPU speed to 300% before enable this code
